  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA&#x2019;s Global Youth Dialogue marking ICPD30 in 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to support the organising of the Global Youth Dialogue in Benin, marking the ICPD30 in 2024. The objective of the Youth Dialogue is threefold: 1) Celebrate young people&#x2019;s engagement in the ICPD-agenda on SRHR; 2) Addressing polarisation by providing a platform for young people and youth organisations to discuss challenges relevant to youth - social movements, sexualities, climate change and humanitarian action, demographic diversity, and at the Dialogue contribute significantly to the ICPD30 Report, which is crucial for positioning UNFPA&apos;s mandate in the Summit of the Future.</narrative>
  </description>
